{"text": "I've run out of steps before completing the design loop. Here is an honest status report.\n\n", "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-ab4067577696986b", "name": "finish", "input": {"answer": "## Status: design NOT completed \u2014 no feasible design, no result reference\n\nI did not get through the round. Nothing below is a validated design; treat it as work in progress.\n\n### What I read\n- `GEMINI_Hackathon_Challenge_Requirements.pdf` (all 4,583 chars, in 4 pages): 2027 daily heating (max 30.0 MWth, 111.67 GWhth/yr, peak 28 Jan) and cooling (max 10.0 MWcool, 23.74 GWhcool/yr, peak 19 Jul); reservoir 2,500 m TVD, 100 m thick, 30 \u00b0C/km gradient, 12 \u00b0C surface, 250 bar(g), 200 mD; brine 1,030 kg/m\u00b3, 0.40 mPa\u00b7s, GLR 0.8 Nm\u00b3/m\u00b3, 80 mol% CH\u2084 / 20 mol% CO\u2082; 1\u20133 doublets, 300 m\u00b3/h max and 50 m\u00b3/h min stable flow per doublet, \u226440 \u00b0C brine cooling, 70 % pump efficiency, equal production/injection volumes, 330 operating days, fixed 100 \u00b0C heating supply and 20 \u00b0C cooling supply.\n- Both demand CSVs (365 daily rows each, `date` + one power column).\n\n### What I did\n1. `set_case` \u2014 created case `gemini_hackathon_2027` with the time axis only: 2027-01-01 \u2192 2027-12-31, step 1 d. **The case is still incomplete**: `demand`, `site`, `utilities` and `requirements` are empty.\n2. `build_plant` \u2014 stored `design/hcp` from the `HeatingCoolingPlant` class (the integrated heating-and-cooling-on-a-doublet topology, which is the right family for this challenge). It has **one open issue**: `site.fluid.density` is missing, because the case has no `site` section yet.\n\n### Why it stopped\nMy `set_case` call that would have filled demand, site and requirements was rejected twice:\n- first because `requirements` must be passed as the separate `requirements` argument, not inside `changes`;\n- then because the demand files were not yet registered on the case (`demand.heating.power.file` / `demand.cooling.power.file` not found \u2014 the `files` list has to be set in the same or an earlier accepted call), and because two of my requirement entries were malformed (`count` takes no `over`; `unmet_share` is not a `plant` quantity \u2014 the plant quantities are `electricity_bought`, `gas_bought`, `heat_surplus`, `co2`, `gas_burned`).\n\n### What is therefore missing\n- No completed case (demand, site, utilities, requirements).\n- No `size_plant`, no full-year `simulate`, no `check_results` verdict, no `optimize`, no `run_study`.\n- No `design.reference` / `design.result` recorded, and no `design.families` or assumptions recorded in the state.\n\n### What the next round should do\n1. `set_case` with `files=[\"GEMINI_Heating_Demand_Daily_2027.csv\",\"GEMINI_Cooling_Demand_Daily_2027.csv\"]`, `columns` mapping `date`\u2192`time` for both, and `changes` carrying `demand` (power by file+column, 100 \u00b0C heating supply, 20 \u00b0C cooling supply), `site` (ground gradient 30 K/km, surface 12 \u00b0C; reservoir 2500 m / 100 m / 200 mD / 250 bar(g) / 87 \u00b0C; fluid 1030 kg/m\u00b3, 0.4 mPa\u00b7s, GLR 0.8) and `utilities`.\n2. Pass `requirements` as the separate argument: `doublet_count` (count, 1\u20133, no `over`), `max_production_flow` (\u2264300 m\u00b3/h each), `min_stable_flow` (\u226550 m\u00b3/h each, when running), `max_brine_cooling` (\u226440 K each), `heating_supply_temperature` (\u2265100 \u00b0C), `cooling_supply_temperature` (\u226420 \u00b0C), and unmet demand as a `heating_supply`/`cooling_supply` `unmet` requirement rather than a `plant` one.\n3. Re-`build_plant` `design/hcp` (its `site.fluid.density` issue clears once the case has `site`), then `size_plant` \u2192 `simulate` (whole year) \u2192 `check_results` \u2192 `optimize` \u2192 `simulate` the best \u2192 `check_results`, and record `design.reference`, `design.result`, `design.family`, `design.schematic` and the study key.\n\nNo requirement of the case was loosened or changed, and no number above was invented by me \u2014 every figure comes from the PDF or the CSVs."}}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 22350, "output_tokens": 1257, "cost": 0.00518787, "cached_tokens": 0}, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017"}
